aims but request one independent validation for H186 to test whether the large WRN/MSI-high association in TP53-loss cells is robust in an independent comparison. Other accepted claims remain closed because the central effects have already been replicated extensively and, for several, independently validated. I registered follow-up direct context tests for the core effects in KRAS-mutant cells and a targeted TP53 wild-type-versus-loss test for dependency_STAT3 to address remaining unresolved outcome and context questions without returning to broad low-prior marker screening.",
